	rtist Panel Conversation with the exhibiting artists from Rebel Girl  and 
	THE VANGUARD\, companion exhibitions featuring the works of three contempo
	rary artists and 20 trailblazing women who exhibited at HCP within its fir
	st 20 years.\n\nhttps://www.edu.hcponline.org/events/in-the-between-conver
